## 🧠 TL;DR
| Situation | Kya karna hai |
|------------|----------------|
| DashboardComponent nahi chahiye | bas uska code hata do, sirf services use karo |
| Teacher ne class chahiye boli | file me ek simple `class DashboardComponent { }` define kar do |

